摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Voice input for DeepSeek Harness: dictation and voice messages with multi-provider STT fallback chains","id":"gh:1339715284","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-voice","slug":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-voice","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","stt","voice"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Voice input for DeepSeek Harness: dictation and voice messages with multi-provider STT fallback chai"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ice input for DeepSeek Harness: dictation and voice messages with multi-provider STT fallback chains"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 📦 @goodandready/dsh-voice"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Zero-Latency Streaming Dictation & Multi-Provider Voice Input for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English •\n🇷🇺 Русский •\n🇨🇳 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"⭐ If you like this plugin, please star it on GitHub — it shows me that the plugin is useful to you a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd motivates me to keep developing it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🐛 If you find a bug or would like to request a feature, open a GitHub issue in any language — I will"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" review your proposal and implement useful suggestions in a future plugin version."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Browser Microphone & Secure Context\\nModern browsers require a **Secure Context** (`https://` or"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" `http://localhost` / `http://127.0.0.1`) for microphone capture (`navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMed"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ia`). When accessing DSH over a local network (e.g., `http://192.168.1.x:3080` via `dsh-lanmode`), b"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"rowsers will block microphone access by default. Serve DSH behind an HTTPS reverse proxy or configur"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"e browser security flags (`chrome://flags/#unsafely-treat-insecure-origin-as-secure`) for LAN IP acc"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"ser security flags (`chrome://flags/#unsafely-treat-insecure-origin-as-secure`) for LAN IP access.\\n"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## ⚡ Overview"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**`dsh-voice`** brings voice superpowers to the **DeepSeek Harness** Web UI. Whether you need hands-"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"free real-time streaming dictation segmented on natural breath pauses or crisp voice notes with keyb"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"oard/mouse Push-to-Talk gestures, `dsh-voice` ensures your audio is never lost thanks to **automatic"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" multi-provider fallback chains**."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## ✨ Key Features\n- 🎙️ **4 Dictation Post-Processing Modes (#264)**: Verbatim (0 LLM calls, raw STT)"},{"id":"p12s2","text":", Clean text (punctuation & filler removal without fact alteration), Agent task (structured problem/"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"goals/criteria), and Note (key thoughts & actions). Customizable prompt templates with 1-click defau"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"lt restore.\n- ⚡ **Dynamic Context-Aware Lexicon Boosting (#167)**: Gathers technical identifiers, co"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"de tokens, and vocabulary from composer drafts, recent chat history, and open code blocks, passing t"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"hem as hints to Deepgram (`&keywords=...`), Groq, local-whisper, and SenseVoice.\n- 🎯 **Voice Action "},{"id":"p12s7","text":"Macros (#167)**: User-defined spoken trigger phrases (e.g. \"review code\", \"run tests\") expand into s"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"tructured prompt templates with `{text}` argument replacement."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"* 🎙️ **Streaming Dictation with VAD**: Speech is automatically sliced at natural pauses (`vadSilence"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"Ms`, default 700ms) and typed into the composer in real time.\n* 🌊 **Voice Notes with Cancel Window**"},{"id":"p13s3","text":": Record your thought and have it automatically dispatched to the agent after a safety countdown (`a"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"utoSendMs`, default 4000ms).\n* 🎮 **Tactile Push-to-Talk**:\n* **Mouse**: Hold the wave button — relea"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"sing sends the message; dragging pointer away discards.\n* **Keyboard**: Hold Ctrl (or custom hotkey)"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" for hands-free speaking; press Esc to cancel.\n* ⚡ **Live In-Browser Captions (`browser`)**: Web Spe"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"ech API speech-to-text with real-time floating captions as you speak (Note: standard browser recogni"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"tion typically streams audio to vendor servers like Google in Chrome; for true 100% offline privacy,"},{"id":"p13s9","text":" use local `whisper` or `sensevoice`).\n* 🛡️ **Ironclad Multi-Provider Fallbacks**: If your primary c"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"loud provider runs out of credits or hits a 429 rate limit, requests seamlessly fail over down the c"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"hain.\n* 🧠 **Context Glossary Injection**: Automatically extracts code variables and identifiers from"},{"id":"p13s12","text":" your composer draft to steer STT model accuracy on technical jargon.\n* 🎵 **Embedded Audio Player**:"},{"id":"p13s13","text":" Preview, scrubber, and playback of your recorded voice message directly in chat and the composer do"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"rubber, and playback of your recorded voice message directly in chat and the composer dock.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 📝 What's New in 0.8.32"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"10-point feature epic & SenseVoice 1-Click Installer (Issue #129):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Area | Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Local ASR | **1-Click SenseVoice-Small** | Automated download and extraction of `model.int8.onnx` "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"and `tokens.txt` directly to `~/.dsh/models/sensevoice` via host loopback endpoint. |\n| Turn-Taking "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"| **Gated Mode** | Microphone input is muted when assistant audio starts (`dsh:tts:start`) and unmut"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ed on `dsh:tts:stop`, eliminating acoustic feedback. |\n| Interruption | **Barge-In** | Speaking imme"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"diately signals assistant TTS to pause and abort current speech playback. |\n| Feedback | **Ghost Int"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"erim Preview** | Semi-transparent live text preview in composer pill during recognition before sente"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"nce finalizing. |\n| Countdown | **SVG Silence Ring** | Circular SVG progress ring visually ticking d"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"own pending auto-send delay. |\n| Control | **Hands-free Actions** | Spoken control words (\"send\", \"c"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"ancel\", \"clear\", \"new line\") trigger actions instead of becoming message text. |\n| Prompts | **Struc"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"tured Prompts** | Spoken replies automatically match and submit options in active harness interactiv"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"e prompts. |\n| Vocabulary | **IT Jargon Normalizer** | Auto-corrects spoken developer slang to canon"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"ical spelling (GitHub, Docker, Kubernetes, etc.) with custom dictionary in Settings. |\n| Configurati"},{"id":"p17s13","text":"on | **Individual Toggles** | Dedicated switches for every enhancement in Settings card with native "},{"id":"p17s14","text":"`--dsw-alias-*` token styling. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 📝 What's New in 0.8.19"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Quality batch after the v0.8.18 review (Gitea #79–#87, PR #88):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Area | Change |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Settings placeholders | Model/path hints resolve through locale at **render time** — no frozen i18"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"n keys (#79) |\n| Model field hints | `whisperModel` / `sensevoiceModel` show path-to-model copy, not"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" binary-autostart hints (#82) |\n| Visualizer | Liquid wave / dynamic orb read **DSH theme tokens** i"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"nstead of hardcoded hex (#80) |\n| Style isolation | Injected CSS uses `data-dsh-plugin=\"dsh-voice\"` "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"so neighbour HMR cleanup cannot strip styles (#81) |\n| Source language | Code comments, errors, and "},{"id":"p21s6","text":"tests are English; EN edit-command phrases added. Spoken RU STT patterns remain for recognition (#86"},{"id":"p21s7","text":") |\n| Locales | **Changed:** the full inline `ru` dictionary was removed. English is the only bundle"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"d locale. Install the translation plugin for Russian UI (#85) |\n| Client source | Browser client is "},{"id":"p21s9","text":"built from ordered `lib/client-src/*.js` fragments via `npm run build:client` (#87) |\n| Process docs"},{"id":"p21s10","text":" | Added `docs/design/DESIGN.md`, `index.md`, project `AGENTS.md`, `docs/testing/unit.md` (#83) |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
